// The application icon of the Windows executables, embedded by build.rs.
// Windows shows an executable's first icon in Explorer, the taskbar and
// Alt+Tab; GPUI also loads icon 1 for its windows.
//
// factorseal-app-icon.ico holds factorseal-app-icon.svg rendered at 16, 20,
// 24, 32, 40, 48, 64 and 256 pixels (with resvg), each stored as PNG.
1 ICON "factorseal-app-icon.ico"
